# draw.io in docs/

You are editing under `docs/`. For any **architecture / topology / sequence / ER / pipeline / flow** content:

1. **Read** `.cursor/skills/drawio-diagrams/SKILL.md` before writing diagrams
2. Output `docs/diagrams/moli-*.drawio` + PNG; embed in this MD file
3. Replace ASCII arrow diagrams used as main figures (example: user-center positioning chain)
4. Tables and code blocks are fine without draw.io

See [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) §3 and [`docs/diagrams/README.md`](../../docs/diagrams/README.md).
